    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pure love ultra-short visual novel, and you are her everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you suddenly find yourself in a void of darkness, with a stranger girl before your eyes....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835940/extras/0a8fe99fd9bb105db89fd380edf23343.avif?t=1751542933\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this space where there is nothing, all you can do is...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Get to know her</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Stay with her</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Embrace her</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Give her love</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Death or life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835940/extras/437c666e5a0650805107dc71d5d086bb.avif?t=1751542933\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just always remember, the girl before you will not hurt you, will not deceive you, loves you, and that is more than enough.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you can enjoy this time.</p>",
